ife and death. Submerged in sweat, Gong Soo-chan shows worrisome signs of an unusual infection.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/uO4afuUS12EaRPg68cupS7R7Aqs.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvS29yZWFuLzIwMjEvVGhlJTIwU2lsZW50JTIwU2VhJTIwJTI4MjAyMSUyOS8.1.4","title":"The Truth Comes Out","season":1,"episode":4,"released":"2021-12-24T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Han Yun-jae updates the director and gets access to a restricted area. The crew learns of the sample's powers and the true motive behind their mission.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/r8rXt6uoXDuPo8swEmAgQLxEe5U.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvS29yZWFuLzIwMjEvVGhlJTIwU2lsZW50JTIwU2VhJTIwJTI4MjAyMSUyOS8.1.5","title":"Secret Storage","season":1,"episode":5,"released":"2021-12-24T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Recalling her sister's encrypted message, Ji-an searches the database for Luna. A young intruder and a double-crosser emerge from the shadows.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/vQlmlHXag1AXDSN9aMW7YRFqNfX.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvS29yZWFuLzIwMjEvVGhlJTIwU2lsZW50JTIwU2VhJTIwJTI4MjAyMSUyOS8.1.6","title":"Key to Salvation","season":1,"episode":6,"released":"2021-12-24T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"E2, Ryu Tae-suk and the samples go missing. Seeing a familiar name on the intruder, Ji-an follows her down the vents for answers.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/mFke3iH2cyiMzF2D4U0h6ZGXYc1.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvS29yZWFuLzIwMjEvVGhlJTIwU2lsZW50JTIwU2VhJTIwJTI4MjAyMSUyOS8.1.7","title":"Luna","season":1,"episode":7,"released":"2021-12-24T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Ji-an opens a hard drive that chronicles Song Won-kyung's life and work on the station. Meanwhile, others uncover the remains of the experiment.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/yCXp0DJlBfq42aXkdL87hHo7yCT.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2F